A list row that goes somewhere carries a count between its label and its
chevron, as a tab carries its badge: what the menu counts beside What's new.
The package has no word for it, so the row takes one, `badge`, which reaches
each renderer as `badge`.

--- a/vendor/nativephp/mobile-ui/src/Elements/ListItem.php
+++ b/vendor/nativephp/mobile-ui/src/Elements/ListItem.php
@@ -107,3 +107,6 @@
         if (isset($attrs['trailingText'])) {
             $this->trailingText($attrs['trailingText']);
         }
+        if (isset($attrs['badge'])) {
+            $this->listItemProps['badge'] = (string) $attrs['badge'];
+        }
